 "9952": {
  "en": [
   "Today my eyes are soothed, beholding",
   "the heart-enchanting twin figures, sweet with union.",
   "The scent of flowers overwhelms; the flute plays in a wistful voice,",
   "the bower is flooded with moonlight;",
   "and in its midst, the heart-enchanting twin figures, sweet with union.",
   "Bring, bring garlands of flowers; bind the two together.",
   "The flower-noose will enter the heart; the bond of love will be imperishable.",
   "Forever I shall behold",
   "the heart-enchanting twin figures, sweet with union."
