 "9953": {
  "en": [
   "Is this a dream? Is this an illusion?",
   "Is this a woman? Is this a woman's shadow?",
   "Ah, who are you, with your pale face,",
   "with lotus eyes half closed,",
   "as if on your own heart's bed",
   "you lie absorbed in yourself.",
   "For you all are gazing and waiting,",
   "for you the cuckoo has broken into song,",
   "the beggar breeze, drifting through the grove,",
   "wanders all day long.",
   "Is this a dream? Is this an illusion?",
   "Is this a woman? Is this a woman's shadow?",
   "As if a wisp of autumn cloud, afloat,",
   "you have come and stood in the court of the moon,",
   "and now, smiling a faint smile, will melt away,",
   "will fall in a shower of tears.",
   "The full moon wakes in the full blue sky,",
   "in the grove jasmine blooms in tier on tier,",
   "for when the smile will bloom on your lips",
   "I wait, holding my thirst.",
   "Is this a dream? Is this an illusion?",
   "Is this a woman? Is this a woman's shadow?"
  ],
