 "9954": {
  "en": [
   "Ah, today in this spring so many flowers bloom,",
   "so many flutes play, so many birds sing,",
   "and my friend's heart, blossom-tender—",
   "by whose neglect does it fall away today?",
   "Why do you come near, why smile in vain?",
   "The one who used to come near no longer wishes to come.",
   "Those who are happy, let them stay happy;",
   "let the spring of the happy pass in happiness;",
   "may the tears in a sorrowing woman's eyes",
   "never be seen by the happy.",
   "They see and yet do not see, they know and yet do not know,",
   "they never even turn to look."
  ],
