 "9955": {
  "en": [
   "I have understood it all — let others understand or not:",
   "in secret two hearts are seeking one another.",
   "You have built your own separation, and there you lie in it yourself,",
   "while longing sits weeping on the heart's lotus.",
   "Why do I stand between, keeping the two concealed,",
   "why stay sunk beneath such a delusion?"
