   "it holds no one back.",
   "Who stays, stays; and who goes, goes;",
   "it never turns to look for anyone.",
   "Alas, alas, if in this world it was never filled—",
   "the lifelong longing of the heart—",
   "then go with a pale face, slowly, slowly turn away;",
